  idleFrameRate: 12
  description: "A master of forbidden magic who draws on its own vitality to fuel dark powers."
  transformationMethod: "As the Mage, reach Curse level three by drinking Dark with no mana."
  transformationPotionSprites:
  - {fileID: -5469023944784030602, guid: 531bc38a7e672414482189974260f0f8, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -5469023944784030602, guid: 531bc38a7e672414482189974260f0f8, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -5469023944784030602, guid: 531bc38a7e672414482189974260f0f8, type: 3}
  transformationHint: "As the Mage, start with no mana."
  cureMethod: "Reach Grounded level three to return to the Mage, clearing Fire and Ice."
  immunePotionSprites:
  - {fileID: 9167658607632584497, guid: 88bee5b2da11771489473878b514bbfb, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 3833926529033503733, guid: 1a1694ee82ded3342bde68515610b0d6, type: 3}
  spells:
  - nome: Summon
    costo: 4
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fb9f5fecebd2eed4cb276bea9340834c, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    descrizioneNormale: "Summons 3 skeletons in the standard setup. Each intercepts 1 Health, Seed, Lava or Light potion, then disappears. Cannot be recast while any skeleton is active. Missing MP is paid with HP, leaving at least 1 HP."
    descrizionePotenziata: "No powered variant is implemented. The effect and payment rules are unchanged."
    descrizioneBreve: "Summon skeletons to intercept harmful potions."
  - nome: Dark-Ray
    costo: 3
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c0f26f7325a16ca469bdfe69d8c8940f, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be6e004ca13cb0e43b0c12546ede7549, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Replaces each non-Dark potion touched by the ray with 1 Dark potion, preserving its motion. The standard ray lasts 0.5 seconds. Missing MP is paid with HP, leaving at least 1 HP."
    descrizionePotenziata: "No powered variant is implemented. The ray and payment rules are unchanged."
    descrizioneBreve: "Turn potions hit by the ray into Dark potions."
  - nome: Second Chance
    costo: 15
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 170e08f83c0e5904395a9009e57b7ef5, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    descrizioneNormale: "Clears all statuses and starts the return-to-Mage animation. Missing MP is paid with HP, leaving at least 1 HP. Does not directly restore HP or MP."
    descrizionePotenziata: "No powered variant is implemented. The effect and payment rules are unchanged."
    descrizioneBreve: "Clear all statuses and return to Mage."

